            "text": "double treble"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " baby blanket is 75 x 90 cm. Each row of dtr is tall enough that the blanket needs only about 45 rows to reach 90 cm. The tall stitches leave open gaps that give the fabric an almost lacy quality."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton on a 4 mm hook keeps the stitch firm enough that the blanket holds its shape. A thicker hook would make the fabric too open and unstable for a baby blanket. Total yardage is around 280 g."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
